{"Component function is declared 'function TwoFactor(...)' while the file exports default BackupCode - should be renamed to BackupCode for clarity": 0.17970353364944458, "Backup code input should normalize by trimming whitespace and handling case sensitivity since crypto.randomBytes generates lowercase hex": 0.5344449877738953, "Object URL created with URL.createObjectURL is not revoked when component unmounts or modal closes, causing potential memory leak": 0.600946307182312, "Used backup code is marked as null but nulls are not filtered before re-encrypting, causing array to accumulate nulls and potentially all codes becoming null without DB being set to null": 0.7507486343383789, "When encoding/decoding backup codes, ensure array shape and types are consistent (string[])": 0.294347882270813, "Server-side disabling using backup code clears all codes instead of removing only the used code - inconsistent with provider behavior": 0.1857980489730835, "replaceAll usage may not be compatible with older Node versions - consider using .split('-').join('') for better compatibility": 0.047742243856191635, "Server-side validation needed to strip dashes and check backup code length equals 10": 0.24192576110363007, "tabIndex={-1} on password visibility toggle removes it from tab order - ensure keyboard users can still toggle password visibility": 0.4678182601928711, "Missing tests for backup code usage during sign-in flow": 0.03327932208776474, "Missing tests for backup code usage during disable flow": 0.022472025826573372, "Missing test to verify same backup code cannot be reused": 0.038229748606681824, "No explicit rate limiting for backup code attempts to prevent brute force attacks": 0.2640891373157501, "When all backup codes are used, DB should be set to null instead of keeping empty/null-filled array": 0.5549756288528442}